{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本「法律系I級女神」AV女優博多彩葉日前被爆出遭到《藍色監獄》男星綱啓永射後不理，原本由男方主動搭訕還發生關係，但疑似紅了就切割女方。博多彩葉現在更是豁出去，怒轟演藝圈有人舉辦「亂交派對」，甚至暗指對方曾與多名AV女優有過不當往來，綱啓永的好友樋口幸平就被網友點名恐怕也是其中一員，引發網友熱議。另一方面，博多彩葉也突然宣布將於11月20日前往台灣工作，意外成為另一個話題焦點。</p><p>發文怒轟「亂交派對」　網友影射樋口幸平</p><p>博多彩葉日前接連在推特發文，直言：「而且說什麼亂交派對，怎麼會有人這麼常辦這種活動啊？」更透露曾有人主動對她表示「沒辦法跟AV女優交往」，如今卻疑似做出與過去說法相反的行為，讓她忍不住痛批：「混帳東西！」她也表示，許多同行女優都曾受過類似傷害，因此已經做好丟掉工作的心理準備，即使因此被提告也無所謂，強調自己會抗戰到底。</p><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149493942947840712504.jpeg/E1LoP7Om7JfdtdIIXyndHnb4cH5ZA_xrh4ErsIeBK7A\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><p>更多AV女優博多彩葉相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149497466294272583096.jpeg/_5BzIPvsOqHn8QYdD957Et8NjvSDmMnej98YDo_fGA4\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149489454780416784362.jpeg/UXVot4t4MtKzfm9hsabqBoWpVpBSUzDTGx0ieRsdInk\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149488297021440853609.jpeg/Ra3sc_UyDoGdSLDekZTVbsLiEz7L_FQmw5UZ7sOVGe4\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149487298777088562043.jpeg/QGv-jSRb_FysRJGYH4CBAu-6SaRstuFS5wIlz-cCJc8\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149495859875840547123.jpeg/cxBshIpU_7lJICWbAsfRReEAAUqa4ExLPU-8Xz1PvF8\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200043101083668480246703.jpeg/bosuNbMQSDZcBZXc1P9hCvBJCvZYZVBXYixXSWIsV0k\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149490419470336986173.jpeg/3dQqNp9DHkoPihly15ARFGW6Kkdh6g9IaezPUWnsz1E\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200043103382278144714529.jpeg/GpxWUUDpFZanP4nnj3u_wcfq43eDR6FJTTrRgk060YI\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185582078373138432805126.jpeg/t0GrQVmHq9YzjcaWjLlAtXOV1ySj-v9akUAyx5FAMsc\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149491669504000468520.jpeg/IA_j6MFBefuhfuC5Dj4u-2JjuNjdR721wSDdGMEg3Rg\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149492420284416475820.jpeg/CYkkG3nHy10h2oYCFdulXSKsvO3djVX-cAt0FHALdBQ\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149302388690944928106.jpeg/x33zLo-3GxIPal1g8dq4SanrTKr-ASfIBKO9zwSjvc8\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185582080856297472693021.jpeg/WOvqoJTefbf_4nFXgirKY3BZO3jyNfM2DJ_49gyf-PY\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149489899376640730254.jpeg/baDCrIPhJWmv0NP3drHJsyjCo3iERamaLeRi7i3kYu4\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149486061457408685123.jpeg/7uS42tyoqB9y-tYJqcCP7eGiKg_JDMvwx4nzYMeJ82A\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><p>此外，博多彩葉再次提及「那傢伙的好朋友也有在開派對」，還爆料這位「好朋友」跟許多AV女優玩過，還質疑對方過去有過更不堪的玩樂方式。由於她先前就曾發文影射綱啓永的好友樋口幸平也有參與派對，加上兩名演員不僅私交甚篤，也都有演出漫改真人電影《藍色監獄》，因此網友紛紛將矛頭指向樋口。不過博多並未直接點名，樋口幸平方面也尚未正式回應。</p><p>博多彩葉曾爆料《藍色監獄》綱啓永私聯開房，發文影射樋口幸平也參加「亂交派對」：</p><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉爆料《藍色監獄》男星綱啓永私聯開房，但疑似紅了就切割女方。（IG@tsuna_keito）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200040193315311616051623.jpeg/znzrtTeIMvM-8kzhTpqxtIpKL6VwGWy-PJHudTyR7nU\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉爆料《藍色監獄》男星綱啓永私聯開房，但疑似紅了就切割女方。（IG@tsuna_keito）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"綱啓永出演《BLUE LOCK藍色監獄》後走紅。（IG@tsuna_keito）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200040195739750400250819.jpeg/M5v6kHZlsaag-Z-PMusT0HwRbz9jw4-Wr1YhyK9WIcg\"/><figcaption>綱啓永出演《BLUE LOCK藍色監獄》後走紅。（IG@tsuna_keito）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"綱啓永（右）出演《BLUE LOCK藍色監獄》後走紅。（IG@tsuna_keito）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200040197941891072531208.jpeg/rJ0d-DK2petTbWGMInu5VHUUO0-wK_g3KoV73SqFe90\"/><figcaption>綱啓永（右）出演《BLUE LOCK藍色監獄》後走紅。（IG@tsuna_keito）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"綱啓永（IG@tsuna_keito）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200040200227917824972063.jpeg/UwfWztDA2A6CsZIGb0ONxQvQXPbryAxs_qtdS_6rXUs\"/><figcaption>綱啓永（IG@tsuna_keito）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉爆「演藝圈亂交派對」，發文影射綱啓永的好友樋口幸平也有參與。（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200041462922743808278593.jpeg/yBgEGnYJnOsAlmXrQafsKic8aQHirC5YLPDKQyzwykM\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉爆「演藝圈亂交派對」，發文影射綱啓永的好友樋口幸平也有參與。（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樋口幸平也出演了《藍色監獄》。（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200046149122134016583604.jpeg/UxopfZplH3MgvNxG33vVoDEFbOdkGNulEMk56RDJOek\"/><figcaption>樋口幸平也出演了《藍色監獄》。（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樋口幸平（右二）和綱啓永（右一）是好友。（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200041466567725056128904.jpeg/cgnalujgxQkPhCNnU9OBLKHCL3lhLaLK90vX0_dL19M\"/><figcaption>樋口幸平（右二）和綱啓永（右一）是好友。（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樋口幸平（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200041468925054976985760.jpeg/sKBE6ujpuyPxnYGjuojltuXe-gncLVmli54_qYueP6k\"/><figcaption>樋口幸平（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樋口幸平（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200041472205131776041967.jpeg/yEcCekY15U0ejweppINSVDp44-UNidRLtzS6i7c0uos\"/><figcaption>樋口幸平（IG@higuchi_kouhei1130）</figcaption></figure><p>博多彩葉強調，自己之所以決定公開發聲，是因為看到同行女生的遭遇，實在無法繼續保持沉默。她坦言，AV女優本身就不容易站出來發聲，面對各種風險更是有所顧慮，但這次已經做好心理準備，即使遭到提告也會繼續抗爭。</p><p>喊話粉絲別過度神化偶像　突宣布赴台工作</p><p>除了接連爆料，博多也將話題延伸至演藝圈粉絲文化，認為粉絲過度理想化偶像，反而可能讓藝人承受壓力，進而做出脫序行為。她更直言，AV女優的工作本來就是脫衣服，但也沒想到這一行會跟演藝圈之間有這麼近的距離，</p><blockquote><p>然而即使在那個圈子裡還是被人看不起，對我來說實在太爛了！</p></blockquote><p>她還呼籲追星族適度看待偶像，「不要過度理想化，試著把對方當成一個普通人來看待吧。」</p><p>面對這波風波，博多也向粉絲報平安，強調自己目前「超級有精神」，認為現在話題正熱烈發酵，反而是增加粉絲的好機會。她最後更透露，自己將於11月20日前往台灣工作，等事情告一段落後，還打算安排泡溫泉，消息也讓網友格外關注。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：簽約拍寫真變拍AV　女優葉月真由揭受騙下海內幕　達人提反面證據（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453597231976448986205.jpeg/y5Qsc-EQOI2_vP8NgHgzECHYxpQ3MKkLKlxOdypcTnc\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：簽約拍寫真變拍AV　女優葉月真由揭受騙下海內幕　達人提反面證據（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由日前發文，大膽坦承當初入行完全是一場欺騙。她在直播中被問及踏入暗黑界緣由，透露當初經紀公司聲稱是拍攝性感寫真，未料簽約後才發現竟是AV經紀公司。（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453365186301952796815.jpeg/gSKuerkp0Y6Abc6s5vURm8EarEvf57ukL-ZqQy_makM\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由日前發文，大膽坦承當初入行完全是一場欺騙。她在直播中被問及踏入暗黑界緣由，透露當初經紀公司聲稱是拍攝性感寫真，未料簽約後才發現竟是AV經紀公司。（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453599480254464790128.jpeg/l_PMyZ_Q2USlIiQHB1VB38NMN60sF5yER3UMZEd1DGQ\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453601678200832694381.jpeg/EU6E_6AnEo3rObkcROUudXHOH_NFbMCKq2Sb26tkm9s\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453603850981376950726.jpeg/6qEACAbkfqG64Nwhp7uuArRmYzOQVQKKcc-OAXHPjgE\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453606019567616631294.jpeg/OIaJd9kiNpaefD_oSsSb9nBEhN-CqHPsyw0ZZssNGWY\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453621303087104647389.jpeg/dIHm5FE-bFaNDFvDuQW2UvUmX5Kw_djRzqwwfc6sMH0\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453623580725248072538.jpeg/kjZRSAxgoUAoYRGhw-8-K1CIcG5GY2f-ZuiTT2bok08\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453626336514048584960.jpeg/31r8dMufZoS3dn7n4UuqsKqqmjd9-bNq3UsjYN1LI2A\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453628932919296854970.jpeg/UzDNTqe3O1mIrY1PT3N3QU_LQKWQ_8E1gROk-4ETpPs\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453631512547328749256.jpeg/d2-aisLTf9qorwCjjf31OgSDloLzvCdYLZSzNS2UszU\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453593314496512406172.jpeg/V-CIPtkiW8ER9TJpHMM0eV8jxcm_5fMMXOI1y1ziNcs\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453595613106176530196.jpeg/7y7E2SSFC4d4A_mQkqd9mx5KqkzyhMkERODicETg4nA\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453597941075968042967.jpeg/Zr9it_3RX6GFRv-7ipNZgJvNt4GLBS61d47DKXeOwyk\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196453600197742592184635.jpeg/dieyDxo9Yx9tk6iP6-NSXbt6Qnj25U_Qc7fQmXO30Jk\"/><figcaption>AV女優葉月真由（Instagram@mayu_nyan1）</figcaption></figure><p>《藍色監獄》男星爆射後不理「I級AV女優」！　她心寒發文證實慘遭洩慾</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:58:56.386041+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2396,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:45:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:53.015538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:52:22.018076+00:00","content_hash":"f38aacb7f1a79fd4a8a35b573f3ef708b4dcbc866b14eca16e4a0f185b82af53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}